@startuml task_fanout
!pragma layout smetana
title Typed projection task: fanout
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

participant "The projector outbox" as PROJECTOR
database "Typed tasks" as TASKS
database "The subject line" as CLAIM
participant "The worker's slot." as WORKER
database "MESSAGE + PLACEMENT" as SOURCE
database "Membership / policy" as POLICY
database "USER_MESSAGE_BINDING\n+ USER_MESSAGE_STATE" as RECIPIENT_ROWS
database "Subsequent Projection Tasks" as FOLLOWUPS
database "The public events repository" as EVENTS
participant "The controller . WebSocket" as DISPATCHER
actor "The client ." as Client

PROJECTOR -> TASKS : immutable fanout(outbox_event_uuid, scope=topic)\nunique derivation; without coalescing
TASKS -> WORKER : Clear work to place
WORKER -> CLAIM : Monopoly (project_id, topic_uuid)
CLAIM --> WORKER : ownership
WORKER -> SOURCE : Read the placement + canonical message
note right of SOURCE
  Order within the topic:
  MESSAGE.created_at DESC
  14:20 -> 14:19 -> 14:15
end note
loop immutable batches: user_uuid ASC; default 1000, max 5000
  WORKER -> POLICY : keyset recipients; active + expected generation
  group One short one. DB transaction
    WORKER -> RECIPIENT_ROWS : bulk conditional upsert binding + state
    WORKER -> FOLLOWUPS : immutable downstream outbox events + tasks 1:1
    WORKER -> EVENTS : durable ready rows + checkpoint/next batch
  end
end
alt membership inactive / generation mismatch
  note over WORKER,RECIPIENT_ROWS
    Stale task Finishes no-op And it never restores access ..
  end note
end
alt Chatting with yourself
  note over WORKER,RECIPIENT_ROWS
    The author link and status already exist.
    No additional receiver lines are being created.
  end note
end
WORKER -> CLAIM : I 'm going to get out .
EVENTS -> DISPATCHER : - I 'm not sure .
DISPATCHER -> Client : Send / repeat / play

note over SOURCE,RECIPIENT_ROWS
  It 's public . UUID = MESSAGE_PLACEMENT.uuid =
  UUIDv5(namespace=TOPIC.uuid, name=MESSAGE.uuid).
  UUID The user binding It stays. hidden.
  Task: lease/fencing, retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper,
  idempotent effect guard The outbox_event_uuid.
  Retry It only repeats batch; OFFSET and unbounded transaction It 's forbidden ..
  After batch scheduler It gives. bounded fairness I 'm going to the old job ..
end note

@enduml
